      "user_id": 39208,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769040794733332
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Jane. One moment... Okay, I see your recent order for the VeloBand Pulse HR Monitor. Is that the item you're calling about?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769040796666665
    },
    {
      "text": "Obviously.",
